{"seq":2,"slug":"rate-card-model-category-hierarchy","title":"费率卡数据模型：费用类目层级、条件/阶梯费率与生效版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/charge-basis-rate-card-engine/rate-card-model-category-hierarchy","wordCount":2794,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"费率卡数据模型-费用类目层级-条件-阶梯费率与生效版本管理\">费率卡数据模型：费用类目层级、条件/阶梯费率与生效版本管理</h1><p>一台标价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mtext>的蓝牙音箱在</mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>美国站卖出，平台按</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>的</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25 的蓝牙音箱在 Amazon 美国站卖出，平台按 Consumer Electronics 的 8% 抽佣；同一件商品若被归到 Electronics Accessories，则是</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的蓝牙音箱在</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">美国站卖出，平台按</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cs</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>100 以内 15%、超出部分 8%。定价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mtext>的同类商品在</mtext><mi>B</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext>类目走</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 的同类商品在 Beauty 类目走 8%，跨过</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的同类商品在</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">类目走</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>10 后跳到 15%。同一笔交易，费率完全取决于「费用类目落在哪」「金额落在哪个档」「计费时刻用哪一版费率卡」这三件事。费率卡（rate card）就是把这三件事编码成可查询、可复现、可审计的数据结构——它不是一份人工维护的费率表，而是一个带版本语义的规则引擎配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>费率卡回答一个函数式问题：给定一笔<strong>计费事件</strong>（谁卖、卖什么、卖了多少、何时成交），返回一组<strong>费用行</strong>，每行带费用类目、费率、计费基数、金额。它有三个相互正交的维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>类目维度</strong>：费用类目是一棵层级树，不是扁平枚举。Amazon 明确说明「商品的费用类目可能与面向顾客的店铺类目不一致」（<a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/pricing\">Amazon Selling Pricing</a>），因此计费类目必须独立于商品目录类目单独维护。</li>\n<li><strong>条件维度</strong>：同一条类目规则内，费率随计费基数、卖家等级、履约渠道、促销期等条件变化。</li>\n<li><strong>时间维度</strong>：任何费率都只在某段有效期内成立；费率调整、追溯更正、临时促销叠加，都要求费率卡保留历史版本而非就地覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[计费事件&lt;br/&gt;item + price + time] --&gt; B[类目解析&lt;br/&gt;最近祖先显式费率]&#10;    B --&gt; C[条件求值&lt;br/&gt;基数/渠道/等级/时段]&#10;    C --&gt; D{阶梯命中}&#10;    D --&gt; E[分段递进 or 门槛断点]&#10;    E --&gt; F[最低费/固定费兜底]&#10;    F --&gt; G[按币种最小单位取整]&#10;    G --&gt; H[费用行&lt;br/&gt;含命中的 rate_version_id]\">flowchart TD\n    A[计费事件&lt;br/&gt;item + price + time] --&gt; B[类目解析&lt;br/&gt;最近祖先显式费率]\n    B --&gt; C[条件求值&lt;br/&gt;基数/渠道/等级/时段]\n    C --&gt; D{阶梯命中}\n    D --&gt; E[分段递进 or 门槛断点]\n    E --&gt; F[最低费/固定费兜底]\n    F --&gt; G[按币种最小单位取整]\n    G --&gt; H[费用行&lt;br/&gt;含命中的 rate_version_id]</pre><p>一张费率卡的数据模型通常由四张逻辑表组成：类目树、费率规则（按条件分行）、阶梯档、版本头（有效期）。理解它们的边界，比记住某个平台的具体百分比更重要——各平台的百分比每年都在变，而模型不变。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费率形态</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>Amazon 实际例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一费率</td>\n<td>对全部基数取同一比例</td>\n<td>Computers 一律 8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段递进（marginal）</td>\n<td>每段独立计费后求和</td>\n<td>Fine Art：首 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext>收</mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 收 20%，</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>100–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext>收</mtext><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000 收 15%，</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收</span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>1000–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn><mtext>收</mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000 收 10%，</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>5000 以上 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛断点（cliff）</td>\n<td>基数落入某档即整笔按该档费率</td>\n<td>Jewelry：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>250</mn><mtext>及以内</mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">250 及以内 20%，</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">及以内</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>250 以上 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最低费（floor）</td>\n<td>计算值低于下限则取下限</td>\n<td>大多数类目 $0.30 最低推荐费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定附加费</td>\n<td>与比例无关的定额</td>\n<td>Media（Books/DVD/Music）每件额外 $1.80 closing fee</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"费用类目层级与继承\">费用类目层级与继承</h2><p>费用类目树的关键设计决策是：<strong>节点存不存费率</strong>。两种极端都错。全部叶子存费率会导致新增子类目时漏配；全部中间节点存费率则无法表达「Office Products 一律 15%，但 Printer Cartridges 例外 12%」这类规则。工程上取折中——节点可挂费率，也可留空表示继承，解析时从商品命中的叶子向根回溯，取<strong>最近一个显式配置了费率的祖先</strong>。</p>\n<p>Amazon 的类目集里，Office Products 就是典型的「父级默认 + 子级例外」结构；Walmart 同样在 Office Products 上注明 15%、但 Printer Cartridges 走 12%（<a href=\"https://marketplace.walmart.com/pricing/\">Walmart Marketplace Pricing</a>）。这类规则无法用扁平映射表表达，必须靠树形继承。</p>\n<p>回溯解析要处理两个边界条件。第一是<strong>兜底类目</strong>：两个平台都设了 <code>Everything Else</code> 作为 15% 的最终承接，且语义被限定为「不属于任何已定义类目的商品」——这意味着解析器在命中兜底前必须先完整遍历树，不能因为找不到匹配就立即回落。第二是<strong>多类目歧义</strong>：一件商品可能同时符合多个类目（例如带蓝光播放功能的音箱），平台通常约定一个优先级或由卖家在后台显式指定，模型需要保存「最终裁决类目」及其裁决依据（自动匹配 vs 人工指定），否则后续对账时无法解释同一 SKU 为何换过费率。</p>\n<p>类目树的存储形式决定了回溯性能。邻接表（<code>parent_id</code>）写入简单但深度回溯要多次查询；物化路径（<code>/Electronics/Consumer-Electronics</code>）和闭包表（closure table）能以一次查询拿到全部祖先，适合读多写少的费率场景。由于类目树变更频率远低于计费事件，用闭包表换取查询确定性通常是划算的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件费率与阶梯费率建模\">条件费率与阶梯费率建模</h2><p>条件维度必须在数据模型里显式建列，而不是塞进一段脚本。每行费率规则形如 <code>(category_id, condition_set, tier_scheme, rate, currency, valid_from, valid_to)</code>，其中 <code>condition_set</code> 是维度组合：计费基数区间、履约渠道（FBA/FBM/WFS）、卖家等级、地区、促销活动。维度值本身也应可扩展——用 JSON 或 EAV 存条件会让索引失效，主流做法是把高频条件固化列、低频条件放扩展列。</p>\n<p>阶梯建模最容易出错的是<strong>递进与断点混用</strong>。Fine Art 的 <code>20% up to $100; 15% from $100–$1,000</code> 是分段递进，各段独立计费；而 Jewelry 的 <code>20% up to $250; 5% above $250</code> 在部分平台的实现里是断点式——基数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mtext>时整笔按</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300 时整笔按 5%。两者在</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时整笔按</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>250 处费率相差数倍，若模型不区分，每月对账都会出现无法解释的差额。</p>\n<p>分段递进的计算式：给定档边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_0=0 &lt; b_1 &lt; \\dots &lt; b_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与各档费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1 \\dots r_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的应收费为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>marginal</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fe