i><mtext>tier</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{final}}=\\max\\bigl(F_{\\text{tier}}(B),\\ f_{\\min}\\bigr) + f_{\\text{fixed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tier</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是币种相关的最低推荐费（Amazon 普遍为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.30</mn><mtext>，</mtext><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>首档为</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.30，Fine Art 首档为</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">首档为</span></span></span></span></span>1.00），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{fixed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 Media 类 $1.80 这类定额附加费。把最低费和附加费建成独立算子而非写进费率，好处是调整时只改一个配置位，不影响任何类目的比例逻辑。</p>\n<p>还需要注意<strong>计费基数本身的定义</strong>。Amazon 的推荐费基数是「标价加运费加礼品包装费的总额」，而非仅商品售价（<a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/pricing\">Amazon Selling Pricing</a>）；Walmart 同样把 shipping/handling、gift wrap 计入总售价。基数解析规则应与费率规则分离建模，因为同一平台不同费用类目的基数口径可能不同——运费是否计税、优惠券是否先抵扣，都会改变基数。这部分口径的细节见本章 <a href=\"./\">计费基数与取整规则</a> 的其他文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生效版本管理-有效时间与事务时间\">生效版本管理：有效时间与事务时间</h2><p>费率卡绝不能就地覆盖。一次费率调整至少要回答两个不同的问题：「3 月成交的订单按哪版算」和「我们 4 月才发现 3 月那版配错了，原始账单当时是怎么算出来的」。前者是<strong>有效时间</strong>（valid time，业务上何时生效），后者是<strong>事务时间</strong>（transaction time，系统何时记录该版本），二者构成双时态模型。只保留有效时间，追溯更正会破坏历史账单的可复现性；只保留事务时间，则无法定位某笔交易该用哪版费率（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitemporal_modeling\">Bitemporal modeling</a>）。</p>\n<p>这正是数据仓库中的 <strong>Type 2 缓慢变化维</strong>：同一逻辑费率保留多行，每行带 <code>start_date</code> / <code>end_date</code> 区间，当前版本用高日期 <code>9999-12-31</code> 或 <code>current_flag</code> 标记，事实表通过代理键关联到交易日期落入的那一行，从而永久绑定当时的时间切片（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slowly_changing_dimension\">Slowly changing dimension</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rate_version_id</code></td>\n<td>版本代理键</td>\n<td>费用行外键，永久绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>valid_from</code> / <code>valid_to</code></td>\n<td>业务有效期</td>\n<td>回答「交易该用哪版」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tx_from</code> / <code>tx_to</code></td>\n<td>系统记录期</td>\n<td>回答「当时系统知道什么」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>status</code></td>\n<td>draft / published / superseded</td>\n<td>发布门控与回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>版本管理还有三个工程约束。<strong>发布前置期</strong>：费率变更通常有法定或合约通知期，欧盟《促进在线中介服务商业用户公平与透明条例》（Regulation (EU) 2019/1150，即 P2B 条例）第 3 条要求平台对条款变更提前通知商业用户，费率属于条款核心内容，实践中平台普遍按提前通知而非立即生效发布——模型里 <code>valid_from</code> 必须晚于 <code>published_at</code>，需要一道校验门禁。<strong>不可变性</strong>：已发布版本的费率字段应冻结，调整只能新建版本，这也是审计与回滚的基础。<strong>变更集绑定</strong>：一次费率调整往往同时改动多个类目，应作为同一变更集原子发布，避免出现半套生效的中间状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本解析与取整的确定性\">版本解析与取整的确定性</h2><p>给定计费事件，版本解析必须在有效时间与事务时间上同时收窄：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi></munder><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>valid_from</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>valid_from</mtext><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>biz</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>tx_from</mtext><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>calc</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^{*}=\\operatorname*{arg\\,max}_{v}\\ \\{\\,v.\\text{valid\\_from}\\mid v.\\text{valid\\_from}\\le t_{\\text{biz}}\\ \\wedge\\ v.\\text{tx\\_from}\\le t_{\\text{calc}}\\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6444em;vertical-align:-0.8944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2056em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">arg</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">max</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid_from</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid_from</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">biz</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tx_from</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">calc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即取所有「业务上已生效且系统当时已知」的版本中 <code>valid_from</code> 最大的一个。这条规则保证了幂等：同一事件在任意时刻重算，只要传入相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>biz</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{biz}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">biz</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>calc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{calc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">calc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，结果一致。重算与追溯更正的区别，正是「固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>calc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{calc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">calc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到原始出账时刻」还是「用当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>calc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{calc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">calc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」——这个选择必须在接口签名里显式暴露，不能靠默认值。</p>\n<p>取整是第二个确定性来源。金额应存为币种最小单位的整数（美分），费率存为有理数或高精度十进制，避免浮点累加误差。取整策略（四舍五入 vs 银行家舍入）要在费率卡层面声明而非散落各处，并且<strong>档位比较应在取整前用整数最小单位完成</strong>：先用 <code>price_cents</code> 与档边界比较定位阶梯，再计算金额、最后取整。若先取整再比较，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10.001</mn><mtext>与</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10.001 与</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.001</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">与</span></span></span></span></span>9.999 可能被压成同一档或跨档，产生难以复现的边界错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>费率卡是一个带版本语义的规则配置，不是静态费率表；它把类目、条件、时间三个正交维度编码成可查询结构。</li>\n<li>费用类目树须独立于商品目录，解析时从叶子回溯取<strong>最近祖先的显式费率</strong>，并保留兜底类目与裁决依据。</li>\n<li>阶梯费率必须区分<strong>分段递进</strong>与<strong>门槛断点</strong>，两者在档边界处结果相差数倍；最低费与固定附加费应建成独立算子而非写进比例。</li>\n<li>费率是双时态数据：有效时间决定「交易用哪版」，事务时间决定「当时系统知道什么」，两者缺一不可。</li>\n<li>版本解析取「业务已生效且系统已知」中 <code>valid_from</code> 最大者，配合整数最小单位取整与取整前比较，才能保证重算幂等与边界可复现。</li>\n<li>费率变更受通知期约束（如 P2B 条例），发布需门控，已发布版本不可变，同一变更集应原子生效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>后续的费用计算执行、账期账单与调账对账见 <a href=\"../fee-calculation-charge-engine/\">费用计算与计费引擎</a>、<a href=\"../billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/\">账期、调账与争议</a>、<a href=\"../settlement-reconciliation-reporting/\">结算、对账与报表</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"费率卡数据模型：费用类目层级、条件/阶梯费率与生效版本管理","id":"费率卡数据模型-费用类目层级-条件-阶梯费率与生效版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"费用类目层级与继承","id":"费用类目层级与继承"},{"level":2,"text":"条件费率与阶梯费率建模","id":"条件费率与阶梯费率建模"},{"level":2,"text":"生效版本管理：有效时间与事务时间","id":"生效版本管理-有效时间与事务时间"},{"level":2,"text":"版本解析与取整的确定性","id":"版本解析与取整的确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计费基数定义与口径：GMV、成交价、运费、税费与折扣的入账范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/charge-basis-rate-card-engine/charge-basis-definition-scope"},"next":{"title":"取整规则、费用分摊与多币种精度：金额舍入策略与分摊残差处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/charge-basis-rate-card-engine/rounding-allocation-currency-precision"}}